1
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
When they put their heads together... it's a no brainer.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Lucky Numbers is a comedy, crime film directed by Nora Ephron.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Russ Richards is a TV weatherman and local celebrity
on the verge of losing his shirt.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Desperate to escape financial ruin, he schemes with Crystal the TV
station's lotto ball girl to rig the state lottery drawing.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
The numbers come up right, but everything else goes wrong as the
plan starts to unravel and the game turns rough.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Russ Richards, played by John Travolta.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Crystal, played by Lisa Kudrow.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Gig, played by Tim Roth.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Dick Simmons, played by Ed O'Neill.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Dale, played by Michael Rapaport.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Detective Chambers, played by Daryl Mitchell.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Lucky Numbers is a 2000 black comedy film directed by Nora Ephron.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
It stars John Travolta, Lisa Kudrow, Tim Roth, Ed O'Neill, Michael Rapaport,  Richard
Schiff, Daryl Mitchell, Bill Pullman, and Michael Moore in a rare acting role.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
The screenplay by Adam Resnick was inspired by the
1980 Pennsylvania Lottery scandal.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
It is the only film Ephron directed without also writing the screenplay.

16
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Lucky Numbers was released on October 27, 2000 by Paramount Pictures in international
markets, BAC Films in France and StudioCanal in Europe and Africa.

17
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
The film received negative reviews and was a box-office bomb,
grossing $10.9 million against a $63 million budget.

18
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
The film explores themes of weather forecast,
lottery, weather forecaster, weather, debt.

19
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:51,000
The tone is lighthearted.
